---
name: example-entry
description: One line a future session reads to decide if this entry is relevant
type: preference
scope: global
created: 2026-01-01
---

The fact, stated plainly in one or two sentences.

**Why:** what makes this non-obvious — the failure it prevents, or the
correction that produced it. An entry without a why gets ignored or
argued with later.

**How to apply:** what to actually do differently, concretely enough to act
on without re-deriving it.

Link related entries with [[their-name]].
